  "summary": {
    "zh-CN": "主持人心里藏着一个化学名词，孩子用是非题来猜，猜中就升一关，从“化学萌新”一路挑战到“万物解谜者”。",
    "en": "The host hides a chemistry word; the child guesses with yes-or-no questions and levels up from Chemistry Newbie to Master of Matter."
  },
